sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Human as 运营/主理人
    participant Collect as collect.js
    participant Parser as evolink-html.js
    participant Official as official-evolink-prices.json
    participant IdMap as id-map-evolink.json
    participant Ledger as models/*.json
    participant Reprice as reprice.js
    participant Pricing as lib/pricing.js
    participant Check as check-pr.js
    participant Audit as audit.js
    participant Dry as align-dry-run.js
    participant Prod as 生产 OmniMux GET /api/pricing

    Human->>Collect: node collect.js --supplier=evolink
    Collect->>Collect: GET evolink.ai/zh/pricing
    Collect->>Parser: parseEvolinkPricingHtml(html)
    Parser-->>Collect: rows[]
    Collect->>Official: 全量覆盖写入快照
    Collect->>IdMap: 读映射
    Collect->>Ledger: 仅刷新 evolink.json 的 cost（不改 sell）
    Collect-->>Human: parsed / unmatched 报告

    Note over Human,Official: 用户根据基准表拍板 discount_rate<br/>写入 policy.official_discount.discount_rate

    Human->>Reprice: node reprice.js --dry-run
    Reprice->>Official: 读官方价
    Reprice->>Ledger: 读全部账本
    Reprice->>Pricing: suggestedSellByRow (按轨)
    Pricing-->>Reprice: sellPatch + clamped 标记
    Reprice-->>Human: 将更新 N 行 / 钳制 M 行 / 兜底 K 行

    Human->>Reprice: node reprice.js --write
    Reprice->>Ledger: 写 pricing_basis + official + sell
    Note over Reprice,Prod: 禁止任何生产写入

    Human->>Check: node check-pr.js
    Check->>Pricing: 按轨验公式
    Check-->>Human: fail_on 空则绿

    Human->>Dry: node align-dry-run.js
    Dry->>Prod: GET /api/pricing（只读）
    Dry->>Ledger: 读新 sell
    Dry-->>Human: ModelPrice / ModelRatio diff

    Human->>Human: 确认 diff
    Human->>Prod: 既有 merge-import（人操作）
    Human->>Audit: node audit.js
    Audit->>Prod: 只读对账
    Audit-->>Human: SELL_MISMATCH 应清空
